  "description": "SharePoint document libraries as a writeable IFileProvider: read, write, append, list, copy and move files through IWriteableFileProvider and Microsoft Graph, with upload sessions, byte ranges, sign-in by secret, certificate or managed identity, and download URLs. The same API as the local disk, Azure Blob, Amazon S3, MinIO, Google Cloud Storage and Box providers. Native AOT compatible.",
